        "raw": "I'd buy a Nemesis Pack, although I'd like it to include a new environment as well.\n\nIn fact, maybe SotM expansions could be like World of Warcraft expansion -- we get a major expansion (Rook City), then a few months later we get a new hero/villain/environment that goes with Rook City, then a few months later we get another, etc.  Heck, things could even build with each expansion the way they do with WoW so that the final Nemesis Pack in the Rook City line could have included The Chairman, making him the ultimate boss of the cycle.  I'd pay money for that.",
