        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"\"Christopher\"\"]\n\nOur next major release as a company will involve a storage solution.  But more on that next week!\n\n[/quote]\n\n\nAwesome!  ;D I'll definitely be looking forward to that. \n\nA little more feedback for consideration: (Unfortunately, there's always different opinions - >G is going to have to do the marketting analysis and find a way to get the greatest bang for their buck! ;) )\n\nOne of the things I like about Rook City is the cohesive flavor of the set. While Matriarch is a little outside of this (she could have come from anywhere), the rest of the set is beautifully cohesive, thematically. Artistically, the entire set is impressively cohesive. (Birds everywhere! 8) ) For me, that's a very big part of my enjoyment of the game. \n\nComing out with individual character decks would be interesting, but I'm not one of the folks who would enjoy that as much as themed set. \n\nMy biggest suggestion for future expansions: Keep 'em coming! Luckily, I don't see that as being an issue. ;)\n\nRabit",
