        "created_at": "2012-04-18T00:00:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just wanted to lay low until I had a chance to play this weekend… my friends where still Magic The Gathering obsessed from PAX but I snuck in one game… 3 vs Baron Blade, I think we barely stopped him before the destroyed the world, after that it was a victory lap.</p>\n<p>I still stand by the idea of boxes, so I cant wait to see what happens, but just for cheap thrills I would love to see some sort of tiny expansions. Meanwhile I have a ton of game to explore, not to mention the “endless replayability” design style.</p>",
